@@ -21,6 +21,14 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Command line
+
+Usage: `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> <options>` (run `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the options of a command).
+
+Landscape commands create or refresh a landscape report, aggregating the repository analyses found under an analysis root (`<analysis-root>/_sokrates_landscape/config.json` and the `index.html` report next to it):
+* `analyzeLandscape`: analyzes or creates a Sokrates landscape report, aggregating results of multiple analyses. It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands and the same as `updateLandscape`.
+* `updateLandscape`: updates or creates a Sokrates landscape report, aggregating results of multiple analyses. Kept for backward compatibility; it is the same as `analyzeLandscape`.
+
